# ─── Supabase (required for Google / GitHub login) ───────────────────────────
# 1. Create a free project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Go to Settings → API to get these values
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# 3. In Supabase: Authentication → Providers → enable Google and GitHub
#    Set the redirect URL to: http://localhost:5173
# 4. Copy this file to .env and fill in the real values
